      {
        "width": 48,
        "height": 19,
        "widget": {
          "title": "How to use this Dashboard",
          "text": {
            "content": "### Description: This dashboard provides data on cluster health \n\n**Source**: The metrics are collected from ONTAP REST APIs and EMS events\n\n1. Nodes not in Ready state \n2. Partner Nodes not in Ready state\n3. Both Nodes and Partner nodes not in Ready state\n4. Historical charts for the status of the Node (When the node transition from one state to another)\n5. How long the Node was in a particular state\n6. EMS Events of Severity type [Emergency and Alerts]\n7. Node Panic, Node OO Quorum, HA interconnect down events, etc.\n\nNOTE: **Prober projects flitered out where possible.** \n\n**Filters**: Node, State, Project (Customer), location",
            "format_": 1,
            "style": {
              "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
              "text_color": "#212121",
              "horizontal_alignment": 1,
              "vertical_alignment": 1,
              "padding": 1,
              "font_size": 4,
              "pointer_location": 0
            }
          },
          "id": ""
        },
        "x_pos": 0,
        "y_pos": 0
